{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":166,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":166,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E6%9C%AA%E4%B9%83%E9%87%8C/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"安守","given_name":"实梨","family_name_jp":"安守","given_name_jp":"ミノリ","family_name_kr":"야스모리","given_name_kr":"미노리","family_name_en":"Yasumori","given_name_en":"Minori","family_name_zh_tw":"安守","given_name_zh_tw":"實里","family_name_cn":"安守","given_name_cn":"实梨","nick_name":"工头","momo_talk_signature":"联邦学生会应保障每周四天休假！","main_relation":57,"relation":[54],"age":17,"grade":"三年生","height":158,"birthday":"07-14","hobby":"罢工、示威、工作","designer":"二色こぺ","illustrator":"7peach","character_voice":"菊池纱矢香","character_voice_cn":"刘十四","release_date":"2023-06-07","release_date_cn":"2025-03-06","release_date_global":"2023-12-12","school":5,"weapon_type":"AR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[517,536,925,924,348,926],"model":[75,308],"voice":[{"description":"CH0214_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"現場の最重要項目は、一に安全、二に安全だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/SFUog85LgwPdeWvtmlx2enrJGb8hCpNZ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"ここの建築様式は…… ……悪くないとだけ言っておこう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/bziA1hLwTEER1j0FzryIaJL64AwwWWrX.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"あたしたち工務部の手にかかれば、この程度……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/ZAmjShCLAQxr7GAM7WsUaMwg3vuOFAvS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"週3日労働……なんて美しい響き……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/sIBICXQvKG7LwjsQD17cXENIqPoPVHFg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"ここのプリンは……事務局から普及されるものとは違うように思うな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/gEx8t0zlrFB9RrbxJlPUaOXqSa8oUabu.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_CommonSkill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"みんな!頭上に気をつけろ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/f4djk3uoUnaQbXJgf8FpiKdtXuMCqDC8.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"低品質なプリンを許すな!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/JLnyAuMnEtz7qLvH2T5z8IURUla72Osc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"レッドウィンター連邦学園の事務局は変革せよ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/az8xuJbNInSWVJW1nkHYYzsqF8Y9VNDQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ストライキを開始する!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/FPFTRm2enVYB7DqlAgTWN7Wm5VcdDNiR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"労働者の権利を!更なる保障を!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/islvQOKavFFCibT5hWm3kSVweQ7vtH6Y.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"全キヴォトスの労働者よ!団結せよ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/7b26g6998X3slwFeGkNn1pu4iHt646Vd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"志を一つに!恐れることはない!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/uIuKbO9SFrFGrY412l5MLfuppevQQ1ap.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"丈夫で信頼できる装備こそ、 現場のベストパートナーだ。 そういう意味で…… こいつはあたしを 失望させたことがない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/EorjCQuBrRKjIIYBbMy23n8xtMRad7i1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"ふむ、今日の現場はどこだ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/IpZhEQpd9BV7OfsGZHfr6s5mHppuUnA4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"最善を尽くし、労働の価値を証明しよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/RyewpOBOKFRRCu4SzLaJZHuo1Nds1xhi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"土木、建設、撤去……工務が必要なときは、いつでも呼んでくれ。革命とストライキなら……なお歓迎だ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/rkuLwb7qLSgysjg3lpPj4MSrZg1HmgIv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"努力と労働の対価として、成長があるのは当然の事だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/ygvB5hOhdFnYOtsXkzPhywuXLfLoIO4q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生の指導は分かりやすくて良い!感謝する!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/qtmSR0W15mx1VAmbx5lAR73N6oyHIXRI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"革命を成功させる為に、啓蒙は必要不可欠だ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/1Ogz3LmbzKgKMUpOj1DRrgDibeB0C3a5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"これで次回の作業も、安全に進行出来そうだ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/jPOv0JlKBSRf3KL0dUyGO4Y9zBVLZjXP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"安全、よし!確認、よし!無事故、よし!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/9gtOORxAf9heBIzV5RqSiQShdTXRnscG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"プリンなら何を混ぜても好きだ。カスタードクリームでも、チョコレートでも、フルーツでも……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/v54ch7HnKgwKJdwG9UP42zxCqcKnevnX.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……水を混ぜたプリンは除くがな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/HapEyGM65yiXoNDpp7EtEHPs6ynDghLf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"（次回のクーデターの名目は、何にしようかな……?）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/pefnWBJMGxbXd9qrylK9OCQTqCyumdTH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、夜勤の頻度が高いのでは……?時間外手当はきちんと受け取っているのか?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/3QuVvrd2DCOH9XMXZHE9vPzxn9Hoy1Iz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先輩は今頃どうしているのだろう……?元気にしているといいのだが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/8At34qOtc6NOgw6l6JI5gviSPJfVAu3W.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"さあ 今日も安全第一! シャーレ無事故新記録を目指そうではないか!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/j7ijsO9VqWiev2ZZCnC2gqB93anEOAOi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_LogIn_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……遅刻ではないか。サボタージュか?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/dadZ5fpFDqeod12jNwBAHJZvdVt8jFh6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_LogIn_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"シャーレの先生がサボタージュすることが一体なんの証明になるのか、あたしには理解できないが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/7dJb3JZ2tcPHwt8jqA2jq7rIstHLTNRy.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ふふ、今日は寒いから、遠くまでよく見えるな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/Z5DZJpHoDMcJTIyxv4b9ajtyHLJ61Dv4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ほら、先生もそこに立ってないで、登って来い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/OWvENWP3fctpYGtFoNaoZ2niRd7TcT3E.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"心配は無用だ。象が登っても壊れないくらい、頑丈に建ててある。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/5jAVFXhK7Op8w5JjwRpTG7xNyJHnRCw1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……そういえばこの足場、あたし達、工務部にどこか似ている気がするな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/99gNhd369g3t3EIioguOfL2Wq1UsNvoM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"建設に欠かせない重要な資材だが、 作業が終わったら、 まるで最初から存在しなかったかのように消えてしまう――","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/By3YLYCvKE2zM1QfAiW0T81ZegUZPvzh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"だからなのかな。 現場のどの風景より、足場から見下ろすこの景色が、 あたしは一番好きだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/RNJpUf0840aBSSKO25YtYGCN5KvAmMhx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"建物の端から更に一歩進んだ先、誰かがこの外壁の外側で一生懸命に汗を流したと言う、痕跡の視点。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/ZTw8Vak58yv6awCgPZcp41armPGaSV3f.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_MemorialLobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……完工した建物からは 感じることができない この景色を、 あたしは、 先生と共有したかった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/34E3xWuIPxTXJTVkwhKf4hNoMd5W2K5k.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生のおかげであたし達の部は、より確固たる物となった!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/JxJInPnyab4qv9r1Ue70QeoduESfVdLN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生になら、いつでも背中を任せられるな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/gmeXyAMgRDbZ5I8C2m9G5YMH1jcSadQo.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"この気持ちは…その…革命的だな!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/g64SrKqBcbD9Oaadp7eEz8rSW8SIa54x.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"独占だなんてブルジョアがやるような悪質な行為だが… 先生が相手だと…少し…欲が出てしまうな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/GGX7uVKcxgUY83XrWYVpg782Bvtvy0gb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Birthday_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ふふ……先生、今日がなんの日か、分かるか?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/YWQGt8mhAvIXLPobCZyHUL1c7QPZtHvL.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Birthday_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"そうだとも。市民が自由を求めて武器を手にし、 勇敢に立ち上がった偉大なる記念日……!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/qPX1oXqJl5xqn7pwd8iqLGYVKjqcBwQq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Birthday_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ん……あたしの誕生日……? あ……忘れてた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/B09tUTb3jZmGH2b80oNpED92HKEayyn7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"おめでとう、先生。 今日は、あなたというもう一人の同志の生誕を祝おうじゃないか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/ZmKzH4EZYMOAJey1rqpYsbfVM8ve8ccn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Halloween_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"過去に、ハロウィン限定のカボチャ混ぜプリンを食べたことがあったが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/5KLs7uJEkbfrXonD8d8ow86mIGXSVoBH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Halloween_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"微かな甘みに高級感があって……これがおやつに支給されるなら、週末の仕事も構わないと思ったんだ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/CBoABfInZllXZkXAv7aEpQp0Scs3xiDV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Halloween_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うひゃっ！？あ、あたしは、今なんて……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/wEEJh7oQGlSgkVX5mdDNsVfP7kWZnxDx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"今年こそレッドウィンター連邦学園の事務局を占拠し、 労働者にとっての地上の楽園が築けますように……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/9BgbS9pXVPndg9m2zS9BFrLgftWnaCNi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"良い子にしかプレゼントを配給しないだなんて……。 サンタクロースめ、やつは悪辣なブルジョワに違いない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/M6cdLMmaPIqf68MrsVb2Rb16ujXLdpla.ogg"},{"description":"CH0214_Title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/TKMu4MqteYWYMz3tzxUW20WFXc7bWI9s.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"在工地上最重要的，第一是安全，第二还是安全。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这里的建筑风格……还算不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"如果把这里交给我们工务部的话， 小菜一碟……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"做三休四……这是多么动听的天籁之音哪……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"这里的布丁……和事务局供应的布丁看着不太一样诶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"大家，当心头顶！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"绝对不能容忍劣质布丁！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"改革红东事务局！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"开始罢工！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"劳动者应该争取权利，要求保证！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"基沃托斯的劳动者，团结起来！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"团结一致，我们无所畏惧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"结实又可靠的装备才是在工地现场的最佳拍档。这么说的话……这家伙从来没让我失望过。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"嗯......今天的工地现场在哪里？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"竭尽全力去证明劳动的价值吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"如果有土木、建筑、拆除等 劳务需求，随时都可以联系我。 如果是革命和罢工，那更是举双手欢迎！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"既然付出了努力与劳动，那成长也是理所应当的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"老师的指导很简单易懂的。谢谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"革命想要成功的话，启蒙是必不可少的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"接下来的工作也能安全进行了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"安全，OK！确认，OK！无事故，OK！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"不管加什么东西，布丁都很好吃！可以放卡仕达酱，也可以放巧克力，还可以拌水果……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……加水除外。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"（下次要用什么名义发起政变呢……？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师夜班是不是上太多了……？有按标准拿到加班费吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"前辈现在在做什么呢……？希望她一切顺利。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天也是安全第一！一起挑战沙勒无事故的新纪录吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊……迟到了啊。是消极怠工吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然我也不理解，沙勒的老师消极怠工是想证明什么……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，多亏今天这么冷，远处也能看得清清楚楚。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"来，老师也别在那儿傻站着了，站上来看看吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"完全不用担心。这个很结实，就算站上一头大象也没问题。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"说起来，这脚手架和我们工务部很像呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然都是建设时不可或缺的重要工具，但每次施工结束后就不见了，就好像从来没有出现过一样……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"或许正因如此，和现场的任何风景相比，从脚手架上俯瞰的这幅景色，才是最美的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"站在比建筑边缘更远一步的地方。有人在墙外忙碌，并挥洒着自己的汗水。每每看到这样的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"……这种在竣工的建筑里感受不到的景色。我就想和老师一起分享。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"多亏了老师，我们工务部变得更团结了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"如果是老师的话，无论何时，我都能放心地把后背交给你呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"这种感情……该怎么形容……就……啊，革命性质的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"虽然垄断是资本家的恶劣行为，但如果垄断的对象是老师的话，我也有些贪心呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿……老师，你知道今天是什么日子吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"没错！ 今天可是市民们为了追求自由，拿起武器，勇敢反抗的伟大纪念日！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"诶……是我的生日……？……啊，我忘记了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝你生日快乐。今天，就让我们一起庆祝又一位同志的诞生吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新春是辞旧迎新的重要日子，所以每年春节前后，我们都会用各种手段保证工务部的成员们能顺利拿到工资。平平安安回家，开开心心过节！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"我曾经吃过万圣节限定的南瓜布丁……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"味道很高级，有着淡淡的甜味……如果能供给这种零食的话，哪怕是周末，我也可以工作……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"诶？！我，我刚刚说了什么……？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，中秋快乐！俗话说，休息是为了更好的劳动。今天要不要和我一起去工地赏月呢？什么，你说你要加班……？岂有此理，我这就去找联邦理事会！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"希望今年能占领红冬学院的事务局，把它建设成劳动者的地上乐园……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"居然只给好孩子发礼物……圣诞老人那家伙，分明就是恶毒的资本家。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue, Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/cn/ch0214_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"CH0214_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/CH0214_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0214_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%88%20%E5%AE%9E%E6%A2%A8/original/ch0214_exskill_lev